    955  f440							; --- D6 M1 (left-col block): M1X = 8*(m1_col+1)-1 -> CollisionEndX ($8E) ---
    956  f440							; 0 = no M1 patch. Window: this VBL write -> PositionBallM1 reads it
    957  f440							; later the same VBL (staged-file pattern like Temp/BallX). Overscan
    958  f440							; routines (PHM/LWC/blast/laser) restage their own CollisionEndX values
    959  f440							; AFTER the cave read, so the alias never crosses a frame boundary.
    960  f440							; NOT zeroed with BandTab on strip kill — M1 is a whole-cave latch and
    961  f440							; convert guarantees its cell is solid/unpatched (wall) where it must hide.
    962  f440							; M1 strip DESTROYED (EnemyDeadMask b4, StripBlastCheck's M1 twin) →
    963  f440							; stage 0: PositionBallM1 skips ENAM1, the pack's b3 flag clears, and
    964  f440							; both overlay paths (PHM/blast) treat the strip as gone next frame.
    965  f440		       a5 99		      lda	RoomMetaA
    966  f442		       4a		      lsr
    967  f443		       4a		      lsr
    968  f444		       4a		      lsr
