   1574  fae9							; arm overwrites for shutter rooms). Runs every VBL this routine does —
   1575  fae9							; bank1 HUD already stomped $EA/$EB/$EC after the cave, so a full
   1576  fae9							; restage here is the only way the next kernel reads sane values.
   1577  fae9							; Idle defaults: VcrBand=$FF (tail dispatch never matches), VcrNext=0
   1578  fae9							; (idle marker — only 1..4 slices), VcrState=0. The band0 length needs
   1579  fae9							; no byte: .Row derives 8/48 from these two.
