   2064  fd78							; Feature-record dispatch ($80 phase / $81 vcrunch / $82 hcrunch — Phase 4):
   2065  fd78							; armed/overlap/kill tests live in bank3 (HOVFeatEntry). $80 phase: b5 armed
   2066  fd78							; (staged by PhaseBlink each VBL) + candidate-box overlap → shared Hot hit
   2067  fd78							; (Temp b7 → bank0 `jsr LoseLife`); kill gated on armed-and-not-removed
   2068  fd78							; (`and #$60 / cmp #$20`), latches b6, PhaseBlink punch forced OFF while b6
   2069  fd78							; set (walls REMOVED, same-room only — EnterRoom zeroes the mask).
   2070  fd78							; $81 vcrunch: sprite shutter — the kill rides the OverlayTramp MISS path
   2071  fd78							; (OvShutTest/OvShutBand, MetaB b7 gate) because the punched cell never
   2072  fd78							; trips this walk. The record path (loop push + HOVFeatPre's 4 field pushes
   2073  fd78							; + bank3 jsr HOVvcrunch) measured SP=$F6 = real BombTimer ($F7) stomp
   2074  fd78							; (sim_bomb_fuse mirror stomp, 2026-10-13) — skip the record here.
   2075  fd78							; Entered with Y = record base + pushed Y (loop invariant), A = mask.
   2076  fd78							; 15B kept: the cmp/beq/jmp + pad replace the old tramp byte-for-byte —
   2077  fd78							; the BombEnemyBlastBody $FD87 pin (kernel tramp operand) must not move.
   2078  fd78				   .HOVfeature
