   2324  fe9c							; OvShutBand — shutter kill on the PHMOverlay miss path (vcrunch_shutter_plan
   2325  fe9c							; Phase B). Entered from PHMOverlay .OvBand (right-column + player-band
   2326  fe9c							; overlap). The punched cell no longer trips the PF cell walk, so the overlay
   2327  fe9c							; path IS the kill trigger: MetaB b7 (convert's shutter flag) gates it; plain
   2328  fe9c							; D6 strip rooms (b7 clear) fall through to plain solid (old .OvBand
