   2330  fe9c							; 2026-10-14 — the left mirror was removed to fix flicker). Where the
   2331  fe9c							; block is closed but the player is not crunched, VCS3 returns SOLID —
   2332  fe9c							; the walk blocks (no walking through a closed shutter, user
   2333  fe9c							; 2026-10-14b); only the aperture at the player's Y is passable.
   2334  fe9c							; Kill = EnemyDeadMask b7 latch (once per room visit — EnterRoom zeroes) +
   2335  fe9c							; Temp b7 -> kernel hot-bump -> LoseLife; latched = wall REMOVED (open
